{
  "title": "Herbal Juicy Venezuelan Apricot Toast",
  "description": "A delicious and healthy Venezuelan-inspired dish featuring dried apricots, fresh herbs, and whole grain toast, perfect for a quick breakfast or snack. This dish is kid-friendly and low in calories.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
